        <headline>SYSTEMS DAILY BLEED AND PRESSURISATION REVIEW</headline>
        <description>BACKGROUND: ACMS REVIEW HAS FOUND RH BLEED DUCT PRESSURE TO BE LOW DURING TAXI  AND DESCENT (10 PSI)
 
